245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (Money that used to be enough for daily needs is no longer sufficient today. Many people are now forced to cut expenses for education and health just to stretch their monthly budget and cope with poverty. The rising prices of goods are caused by various factors such as global oil prices, supply chain issues, and lack of food production. Often, the government and the private sector have a role in regulating prices, but their efforts are not always enough to protect the citizens. At the family level, proper budgeting and saving can help lessen the immediate impact of price increases. Inflation, or the rise in the cost of goods, is a challenge that cannot be ignored. It is time to become informed and prepared for expenses, while collectively calling for measures that will help our people. With the right information, discipline, and support for the local economy, the effects of rising prices on every family can be eased. Through cooperation and unity, we can achieve real change in our country.)
/E (Money that used to be enough for daily needs is no longer sufficient today. Many people are now forced to cut expenses for education and health just to stretch their monthly budget and cope with poverty. The rising prices of goods are caused by various factors such as global oil prices, supply chain issues, and lack of food production. Often, the government and the private sector have a role in regulating prices, but their efforts are not always enough to protect the citizens. At the family level, proper budgeting and saving can help lessen the immediate impact of price increases. Inflation, or the rise in the cost of goods, is a challenge that cannot be ignored. It is time to become informed and prepared for expenses, while collectively calling for measures that will help our people. With the right information, discipline, and support for the local economy, the effects of rising prices on every family can be eased. Through cooperation and unity, we can achieve real change in our country.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (At present, one of the biggest issues in the country is the continuous increase in the prices of goods, or inflation. Every day, citizens notice that food, transportation fare, and other basic needs are becoming more expensive. This problem affects every family, especially those who are poor. Many families struggle to buy their necessities because of the ongoing inflation. Students, workers, and ordinary families feel its effects. As a result, they experience stress, depression, and worry about their future. According to reports from the PSA and the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas, the inflation rate has increased by 3% this year. Many products, from rice to gasoline, have gone up in price. We need enough support from our government to help families who are suffering in our country.)
/E (At present, one of the biggest issues in the country is the continuous increase in the prices of goods, or inflation. Every day, citizens notice that food, transportation fare, and other basic needs are becoming more expensive. This problem affects every family, especially those who are poor. Many families struggle to buy their necessities because of the ongoing inflation. Students, workers, and ordinary families feel its effects. As a result, they experience stress, depression, and worry about their future. According to reports from the PSA and the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas, the inflation rate has increased by 3% this year. Many products, from rice to gasoline, have gone up in price. We need enough support from our government to help families who are suffering in our country.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [7 8 9]
>>
