339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (She dreams not only of finishing high school but also of helping her family and giving back to her community. Her education is a tool to break the cycle of poverty, and she wields it with courage and discipline, refusing to let circumstances define her future.Her sleepers may wear thin, but her spirit never does. Every day she walks is a testament to hope, courage, and relentless determination ma reminder that success is earned through perseverance, not comfort.As Ritchel strides forward, rain or shine, barefooted in spirit if not literally, she teaches a lesson that resonates far beyond the classroom: ordinary beginnings, when paired with resilience and heart, can lead to extraordinary destinations.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13]
>>
