404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Beyond saving lives, flood control projects protect the economy and infrastructure. According to the Department of Public Works and Highways \(DPWH\), billions of pesos are lost annually due to flood-related damages. Roads, bridges, and farmlands often bear the brunt of heavy rains. By improving drainage networks and building retention basins, the government ensures that transportation, agriculture, and local businesses continue to operate even during the rainy season. Flood management also plays a key role in public health. Stagnant water after floods becomes a breeding ground for mosquitoes that cause dengue and malaria. Contaminated water sources may also lead to outbreaks of leptospirosis and diarrhea. With effective flood control systems, water can be drained more efficiently, reducing the risk of these post-flood diseases. Environmental balance is another crucial factor. While concrete structures help divert floodwaters, green engineering solutions such as mangrove reforestation, urban green spaces, and rain gardens also contribute to natural flood absorption. These eco-friendly measures not only prevent flooding but also support biodiversity and cleaner air.)
/E (Beyond saving lives, flood control projects protect the economy and infrastructure. According to the Department of Public Works and Highways \(DPWH\), billions of pesos are lost annually due to flood-related damages. Roads, bridges, and farmlands often bear the brunt of heavy rains. By improving drainage networks and building retention basins, the government ensures that transportation, agriculture, and local businesses continue to operate even during the rainy season. Flood management also plays a key role in public health. Stagnant water after floods becomes a breeding ground for mosquitoes that cause dengue and malaria. Contaminated water sources may also lead to outbreaks of leptospirosis and diarrhea. With effective flood control systems, water can be drained more efficiently, reducing the risk of these post-flood diseases. Environmental balance is another crucial factor. While concrete structures help divert floodwaters, green engineering solutions such as mangrove reforestation, urban green spaces, and rain gardens also contribute to natural flood absorption. These eco-friendly measures not only prevent flooding but also support biodiversity and cleaner air.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14 15 16]
>>
endobj
